---
import DefaultPageLayout from "../../layouts/DefaultPageLayout.astro";
import Petapetual from "../../components/Petapetual.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
---

<DefaultPageLayout
    title="Late Pets"
    description="Losing a pet is losing a family member. Learn how to cope with the grief and honour their memory. Petapetual offers a beautiful online pet memorial to celebrate their life."
>
    <article class="article-container">
        <a href="/examples" class="back-link">
            <i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> All Use Cases
        </a>

        <Image
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1450778869180-41d0601e046e?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=2186"
            alt="Pets are part of the family. Honor them with a Petapetual online memorial and cherish their life with you!"
            class="article-hero"
            width="2186"
            height="400"
        />

        <h1 class="article-title">
            <Petapetual /> for pets across the rainbow bridge
        </h1>

        <p class="article-text">
            Losing a pet is a heartbreaking experience. For many of us, our pets
            are cherished family members. They are a constant, loving presence
            in our daily lives, offering silent comfort and unconditional love.
            The quiet house, the empty spot where they used to sleep, the
            un-greeted return home... it all leaves a profound ache.
        </p>

        <p class="article-text">
            This grief is real and it is deep. Because the bond we share with
            them is so special, we feel a powerful need to honour their memory
            when they're gone. We want to celebrate the joy, laughter, and
            comfort they brought into our lives. We find ourselves looking
            through old photos, remembering their funny quirks, and wanting a
            way to pay respects to the little soul who gave so much.
        </p>

        <p class="article-text">
            This desire to remember is a testament to the love we shared. It's a
            way to acknowledge their important place in our family and to have a
            space where we can reflect on that happy companionship.
        </p>

        <p class="article-text">
            At <Petapetual />, we understand that this loss is the loss of
            family. We created our online memorials to offer a beautiful,
            lasting space where you can build a heartfelt tribute to your
            beloved companion. It's a place to share your favorite photos, write
            down those sweet or funny stories, and create a permanent
            celebration of the life you shared. It gives you a special place to
            visit, remember, and honour the unconditional love they gave.
        </p>

        <div class="article-cta">
            <a href="https://app.petapetual.com" class="cta-btn">
                Create a Memorial <i class="fas fa-arrow-right ml-1"></i>
            </a>
        </div>
    </article>
</DefaultPageLayout>

<style>
    @reference "tailwindcss";

    .article-container {
        @apply flex flex-col gap-6;
    }

    .back-link {
        @apply text-slate-500 text-sm no-underline;
        @apply hover:text-slate-700 transition-colors;
    }

    .article-hero {
        @apply w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-sm;
        @apply lg:h-72;
    }

    .article-title {
        @apply text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800;
        @apply lg:text-3xl;
    }

    .article-text {
        @apply text-slate-600 leading-relaxed;
    }

    .article-cta {
        @apply mt-4 py-8 text-center;
        @apply border-t border-slate-200;
    }

    .cta-btn {
        @apply inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-slate-600 text-white rounded-lg font-semibold no-underline;
        @apply hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors;
    }
</style>
